OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after fireworks
OL,4,Adisplay sexual assaults
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after two women
OL,7,Freported being sexually assaulted at a
OL,8,FBonfire Night fireworks display.
OL,10,FSussex Police said a 27-year-old man
OL,11,Ffrom Worthing, West Sussex, was held
OL,12,Fand later bailed after the women said
OL,13,Fthey were inappropriately touched over
OL,14,Ftheir clothing on the town's promenade
OL,15,Fduring its fireworks display on 5
OL,16,FNovember.
OL,18,FA force spokesperson said it was also
OL,19,Fseeking a third women who was seen to
OL,20,Fhave been assualted at the event.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
